  "details": "In the Beta, Icons were always visible from all distances while nameplates were enabled. In the live build, (currently Build 1026) Icons dissapear when up close, which gives them a more interesting use. I don't want to use an account wide nameplate Icon, but rather an avatar bound nameplate icon.\nThis would allow players to track users by their avatar's face from a distance, while hiding the unnecessary icon when you're actually close enough to see the user's face.",
